  "title": "GamesIndustry.biz HR Summit reveals new People and Workplace focus, dedicated to shaping the future of games workplaces",
  "content": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/hr-summit-2025.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>This year's GamesIndustry.biz HR Summit, <a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/save-the-date-the-gamesindustrybiz-hr-summit-returns-in-october\">returning to the Royal Institution on October 1</a>, will have a new focus on People and Workplaces, with a series of sessions featuring, and speaking to, both HR professionals and business leaders on what the modern games workplace needs to be in a time of ongoing turmoil in the industry.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamesindustrybiz-hr-summit-reveals-new-people-and-workplace-focus-dedicated-to-shaping-the-future-of-games-workplaces\">Read more</a></p>",
